    <outline text="Katrina">
      <outline text="PW's special edition of Digital Flotsam [Show Link &lt;http://mp3.digitalflotsam.podshow.com/SpecialEdition.mp3&gt;]"/>
      <outline text="Reaction on Katarina">
        <outline text="Hi Adam,&#10;&#10;I would like to reflect on your call for help for the people in New Orleans.&#10;First of all I want to say that it must be horrible to encounter and I&#10;certainly don't want it to happen to me. But (and yes there is allways a&#10;but) yesterday also 900+ iraq people died on a bridge. And I am not hearing&#10;anybody care about that, what makes Americans more important than the people&#10;of Iraque? Most of those Americans have money and are insured but those poor&#10;citizens of iraque have nothing. The goal of my message is not to upset the&#10;people in New Orleans but to try to open the eyes of all the other people in&#10;the world. To let them see how much they are being manipulated by the media,&#10;the media acts like the many people in Iraq dying are just numbers but when&#10;it are Americans or citizens of any other western nation are special and the&#10;coverage is more emotional and personal in order to get many people&#10;involved. I plee for a more objective coverage of the news because todays&#10;journalism is not real journalism anymore it is more sensation and&#10;subjective coverage than nice objective coverage which is assisted by&#10;evidence.&#10;So far my opinion on todays journalism i would like to here your reflections&#10;on this.&#10;&#10;Greetings&#10;Basiel"/>
      </outline>
