      <outline text="My 2 year old son wishing you an early Happy Birthday!">
        <outline text=" Devon Ostendorf 	&#10;&#10;Hey Adam,&#10;&#10;  My son Kaden has such a tremendous interest in&#10;talking into the microphone that he is considering&#10;starting his own podcast.&#10;&#10;  Though he isn't allowed to listen to your show&#10;quite yet, I told him you had inspired many to get&#10;started on their own shows and that you had a birthday&#10;coming up.  He thought you might appreciate an early&#10;Happy Birthday greeting so here it is!&#10;&#10;Hope you have a good one,&#10; Devon&#10;&#10;P.S. I don't have a server handy at the moment to plop&#10;this file out on, so hopefully this doesn't foul up&#10;your inbox too much - it is not terribly large.  Sorry.."/>
        <outline text="HappyBdayAdamCurry"/>
      </outline>
      <outline text="Happy Birthday Christina">
